{"seo":{"title":"Indira Gandhi College of Nursing, Kochi | B.Sc. Nursing in Kadavanthra","description":"A four-year B.Sc. Nursing course at Indira Gandhi College of Nursing, Kadavanthra, Kochi, with clinical training at Indira Gandhi Co-operative Hospital. Affiliated with KUHS; approved by INC and KNC."},"hero":{"image":{"src":"/images/nursing.jpg","alt":"Healthcare trainees in blue scrubs practising with a stethoscope","width":1200,"height":800},"crumbs":[{"label":"Home","href":"/"},{"label":"College of Nursing","href":"/college-of-nursing"}],"tag":"","title":{"before":"","accent":"Indira Gandhi College of Nursing","after":", Kochi"},"lead":"A four-year B.Sc. Nursing course, taught inside a multispeciality hospital.","ctas":[{"label":"Explore Admissions","href":"#admission","style":"primary"},{"label":"Visit College Website","href":"#","style":"light"},{"label":"Download Prospectus","href":"#","style":"light"}]},"sections":[{"id":"about","paragraphs":["Indira Gandhi College of Nursing, established in 2006 at Kadavanthra, Kochi, offers a four-year Bachelor of Science in Nursing programme. Students receive academic instruction at the college and clinical training at Indira Gandhi Co-operative Hospital (IGCH), gaining experience in different areas of patient care.","The college is affiliated with Kerala University of Health Sciences and approved by the Indian Nursing Council and the Kerala Nursing Council."]},{"id":"why","heading":"Why choose Indira Gandhi College of Nursing?","cards":[{"title":"Clinical training at a multi-speciality hospital","paragraphs":["Students gain clinical experience at Indira Gandhi Co-operative Hospital, with exposure to different medical and surgical departments. Their training includes patient care in general wards, OPD, ICU, CCU, operation theatres and emergency services."]},{"title":"Learning across specialised departments","paragraphs":["The hospital's specialist departments provide students with exposure to different areas of nursing practice, including heart care, cancer care and dialysis and kidney care."]},{"title":"A co-operative healthcare environment","paragraphs":["IGCH is managed by Cochin Co-operative Hospitals Society Ltd. The hospital follows a co-operative approach to healthcare, with a focus on accessible treatment and patient support. Students learn in an environment where patient care and community health are important parts of hospital practice."]},{"title":"Faculty, hostel and campus facilities","paragraphs":["Students are guided by experienced nursing faculty and have access to classrooms, a library, computer facilities, hostel accommodation and a dining facility. The hostel is supervised by a warden, and transport is provided for community health postings."]}]},{"id":"course","heading":"B.Sc. Nursing Course Details","facts":[{"label":"Course","value":"Bachelor of Science (B.Sc.) Nursing"},{"label":"Duration","value":"Four years"},{"label":"Intake","value":"50 seats"},{"label":"Affiliation","value":"Kerala University of Health Sciences"},{"label":"Approvals","value":"Indian Nursing Council and Kerala Nursing Council"},{"label":"Admission","value":"LBS allotment"},{"label":"Hostel","value":"Warden-supervised accommodation with dining facilities"},{"label":"Location","value":"Gandhinagar, Kadavanthra, Kochi, Keralam – 682020"}],"tone":"dark"},{"id":"clinical-training","heading":"Clinical Training at IGCH","paragraphs":["Clinical training at a multispeciality hospital gives nursing students opportunities to learn about different conditions, treatments and patient care requirements.","Some of the key areas of exposure include:"],"cards":[{"title":"Heart Care","paragraphs":["Students gain exposure to cardiology and cardiothoracic and vascular surgery, including patient care before and after cardiac procedures."],"ctas":[{"label":"Explore Heart Care","href":"/specialities/karunya-hridayalaya","style":"light"}]},{"title":"Cancer Care","paragraphs":["Training includes exposure to medical and surgical oncology, chemotherapy-related care and the nursing support required by cancer patients and their families."],"ctas":[{"label":"Explore Cancer Care","href":"/specialities/super-specialities#departments","style":"light"}]},{"title":"Dialysis and Kidney Care","paragraphs":["Students learn about related conditions and the nursing care involved in dialysis and the management of patients with kidney disease."],"ctas":[{"label":"Explore Dialysis and Kidney Care","href":"/facilities/dialysis","style":"light"}]}],"after":["Other clinical postings include emergency care, ICU, operation theatre, obstetrics, paediatrics and general medicine."]},{"id":"campus","heading":"Campus Facilities","paragraphs":["The college provides facilities to support academic learning and student life, including:"],"items":["Classrooms and smart learning facilities","Library with nursing textbooks and journals","Computer laboratory","Experienced nursing faculty","Warden-supervised hostel","Dining facility and canteen","Transport for community health postings","Anti-Ragging Cell"]},{"id":"admission","heading":"Admission to B.Sc. Nursing","paragraphs":["Admission to the B.Sc. Nursing programme is through LBS allotment, subject to the applicable eligibility criteria and admission guidelines.","Students can refer to the latest admission notifications and college prospectus for information about eligibility, application procedures, fees and available seats."],"ctas":[{"label":"Admission Details","href":"#","style":"primary"},{"label":"Download Prospectus","href":"#","style":"light"}],"after":["For admission enquiries, contact the college office."]},{"id":"contact","heading":"Location and Contact","paragraphs":["Indira Gandhi College of Nursing is located on the campus of Indira Gandhi Co-operative Hospital, Gandhinagar, Kadavanthra, Kochi, Ernakulam, Keralam – 682020.","The hospital is opposite Rajiv Gandhi Indoor Stadium."],"facts":[{"label":"Phone","value":"0484 2204110, 2206734","href":"tel:04842204110"},{"label":"Email","value":"igcon.cochin@yahoo.com","href":"mailto:igcon.cochin@yahoo.com"}],"ctas":[{"label":"View location on map","href":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Indira+Gandhi+Co-operative+Hospital+Kadavanthra+Kochi","style":"light"}]}],"cta":{"heading":"","link":{"label":"","href":"#"}}}