{"seo":{"title":"Indira Gandhi Co-operative Hospital · Kadavanthra, Kochi","description":"Cardiology, cancer care for adults and children, dialysis and 24/7 emergency in Kadavanthra, Kochi - a co-operative hospital serving Kochi for 50+ years."},"hero":{"tag":"Kochi's Very Own Hospital. {{years}} Years.","title":{"line1":"Advanced care.","accent":"Co-operative","rest":"at heart."},"lead":"For over 50 years, IGCH has provided specialist healthcare with a people-first approach, guided by its co-operative values. We believe everyone deserves equal respect and care that responds to their individual needs. From heart and cancer care to dialysis and 24/7 emergency services, we strive to make quality healthcare accessible to individuals and families from all walks of life.","secondaryCta":{"label":"Meet your doctor","href":"/doctors"},"search":{"label":"What do you need today?","placeholder":"A condition, treatment or doctor","buttonLabel":"Search","emptyText":"No match yet. Try a speciality such as cardiology or dialysis, or call 0484 294 1600 and we will guide you."},"chips":[{"label":"Cardiology","href":"/specialities/karunya-hridayalaya"},{"label":"Cancer care","href":"/doctors?q=Oncology"},{"label":"Paediatric cancer care","href":"/doctors?q=Paediatric%20Oncology"},{"label":"Dialysis","href":"/facilities/dialysis"},{"label":"Emergency care","href":"/facilities#emergency"},{"label":"Psychiatry","href":"/doctors?q=Psychiatry"}],"image":{"src":"/images/igch-building.jpg","alt":"Indira Gandhi Co-operative Hospital building in Kadavanthra, with the 24x7 Emergency entrance","width":1024,"height":1536},"fiveG":{"badge":"5G","newLabel":"New · Kerala's first","title":"5G Smart Ambulance","subtitle":"Care begins before you reach us.","linkLabel":"Learn more →","href":"/facilities#ambulance"}},"stats":{"ariaLabel":"IGCH in numbers","items":[{"value":"{{years}}","caption":"years of healthcare built around people","style":"green"},{"value":"{{haemodialysis-sessions}}","caption":"h